00:00:58.619 --> 00:01:06.299
rumor. I only print the truth. And if you haven't noticed, I print it on page one, section

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:21.459
B, every week. Ron, I know for a fact that this guy's on steroids. He's a juicer. I could smell the

00:01:21.459 --> 00:01:27.159
slow, roasting ink of tomorrow's headline. Well, you said you wanted someone with their finger

00:01:27.159 --> 00:01:36.159
on the pulse of the city. Well, I just hit an artery. Well, if it isn't the steroid stallion.

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:44.230
What? Don't you have some muscle cocktail mixing a do? You ruined my life!

00:01:46.099 --> 00:01:48.099
You don't even care, do you?

00:01:48.099 --> 00:01:49.099
Oh, please.

00:01:49.099 --> 00:01:52.599
If you didn't want to get red rovered by the meteors lineup,

00:01:52.599 --> 00:01:55.599
maybe you should have reconsider jamming that needle into your push.

00:01:55.599 --> 00:01:57.599
You're pretty quick to get high and mighty.

00:01:57.599 --> 00:02:00.599
