00:02:00.599 --> 00:02:02.599
And I think you've destroyed enough lives.

00:02:02.599 --> 00:02:05.599
I'm not gonna let you destroy me.

00:02:05.599 --> 00:02:06.599
Yeah.

00:02:06.599 --> 00:04:37.720
You didn't ditch prime time on your social calendar

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:40.720
