00:04:40.720 --> 00:04:44.610
Chloe, uh, let's propose.

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:45.610
And?

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:49.870
And I haven't given him an answer yet.

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:54.370
I'm sure that's going over well.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.370
Yeah.

00:04:55.370 --> 00:04:58.370
Lex and I are in a really great place right now,

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:02.939
but when I actually heard those words,

00:05:02.939 --> 00:05:09.230
there was something that wouldn't let me say yes.

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.230
Something like Clark?

00:05:11.230 --> 00:05:16.269
When I was with Clark?

00:05:16.269 --> 00:05:19.269
I would have said yes without hesitating.

00:05:19.269 --> 00:05:28.160
I thought that chapter of my life was over.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:33.610
Lana, I think that you need to stop reading between the lines

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:35.110
and actually talk to Clark.

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:39.110
to Clark before you're going to be able to close this book on him forever.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:06:15.089
Scooper?

00:06:15.089 --> 00:06:17.089
Hotshot 485?

00:06:17.089 --> 00:06:21.389
You've got to be kidding me.

00:06:21.389 --> 00:06:24.389
Look, I'm not the one up all night tooling the internet for green aeropics.

