No, really.

00:06:45.829 --> 00:06:46.829
Oh, well.

00:06:46.829 --> 00:06:48.829
Well, the guy doesn't get out of the suicide slot as much,

00:06:48.829 --> 00:06:50.829
so I just hung out there for a few weeks.

00:06:50.829 --> 00:06:54.829
In my car with my pepper spray and the doors locked.

00:06:54.829 --> 00:06:57.829
This is it? A bunch of arms and legs.

00:06:57.829 --> 00:06:59.829
Nice work, hot shot.

00:06:59.829 --> 00:07:03.829
