Well, at least you got a good look at that.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:29.980
Hey, Chloe.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:31.980
Have you seen The Daily Planet this morning?

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:32.980
No.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:37.339
