00:07:37.339 --> 00:07:50.189
this in the paper. Lex proposed to Lana.

00:07:50.189 --> 00:07:52.189
What'd she say?

00:07:52.189 --> 00:08:01.649
She hasn't given him an answer.

00:08:01.649 --> 00:08:06.240
It says here it's because of me.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:08.240
Is this true?

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:19.310
Chloe? I know better. I know better.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:35.950
Tried so hard to let Lana go that if she marries Lex,

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:43.529
there's no going back. Is it true?

00:08:43.529 --> 00:08:47.529
