00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:23.480
I have to do that.

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:32.559
I was feeling alone waiting for your answer.

00:09:32.559 --> 00:09:37.740
I didn't realize I had so much company.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:38.740
I don't know what to say.

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:49.059
When I was with Clark,

00:09:49.059 --> 00:09:51.059
I would have said yes without hesitating.

00:09:51.059 --> 00:10:01.230
You know, the worst part of waiting

00:10:01.230 --> 00:10:07.659
