00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.080
See, I highly doubt she'll say no, Clark.

00:11:45.080 --> 00:12:04.820
Now that she's carrying my child.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:10.820
So you're telling me you think that Metropolis's most worshipped meathead was murdered.

00:12:10.820 --> 00:12:13.820
Hey, now that's my childhood hero you're talking smack about.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.820
And the one baseball card I still can't manage to snag.

