00:12:58.299 --> 00:12:59.299
I have to get approval.

00:12:59.299 --> 00:13:00.299
Approval?

00:13:00.299 --> 00:13:01.299
Oh, please.

00:13:01.299 --> 00:13:03.299
This pulpric lives or dies from my column.

00:13:03.299 --> 00:13:05.299
