A little bit different perspective from down here.

00:14:10.299 --> 00:14:12.299
Yeah, well, this is a good way to strengthen your core.

00:14:12.299 --> 00:14:13.299
Trust me.

00:14:13.299 --> 00:14:14.299
Oh!

00:14:14.299 --> 00:14:15.299
Oh!

00:14:15.299 --> 00:14:16.299
Oh!

00:14:16.299 --> 00:14:17.299
Oh!

