I didn't realize that my core was in question.

00:14:21.299 --> 00:14:23.299
You really want to keep talking?

00:14:23.299 --> 00:14:39.529
Hey.

00:14:39.529 --> 00:14:45.269
Scratch, don't worry about it.

00:14:45.269 --> 00:14:47.269
A scratch?

00:14:47.269 --> 00:14:48.269
Mm-hmm.

00:14:48.269 --> 00:14:50.269
How did that happen?

00:14:50.269 --> 00:14:53.269
Um, it was a fencing accident.

