Trust me, it looks worse than it feels, okay?

00:15:02.269 --> 00:15:05.679
I promise.

00:15:05.679 --> 00:15:06.679
Thank you for all of the shocker of your organization.

00:15:06.679 --> 00:15:10.679
I love the shocker reorganizing, but I have to go.

00:15:10.679 --> 00:15:11.679
Well, uh...

00:15:11.679 --> 00:15:50.379
Okay, bye.

00:15:50.379 --> 00:15:52.379
Smallville. Sorry about the article.

00:15:52.379 --> 00:15:54.379
It's bad enough to have a broken heart,

