00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:14.679
If you ask me, I think a secret is just a big loop

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.700
and the whole thou shalt not lie clause.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.700
There's just no gray area with you, is there?

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.700
Not when someone I thought I knew better than anyone

00:16:21.700 --> 00:16:23.700
