00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:49.070
Who exactly are we talking about?

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:53.070
Green Arrow, aka Oliver Queen.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:56.769
Oliver?

00:16:56.769 --> 00:16:58.769
Jimmy snapped photos of Green Arrow

00:16:58.769 --> 00:17:02.769
