00:17:49.589 --> 00:17:51.589
Wait, let me guess.

00:17:51.589 --> 00:17:54.589
You're covering for the new pledge of your hero fraternity.

00:17:54.589 --> 00:17:57.589
Look, last time Lois said she had a lead on the green arrow, she was just bluffing.

00:17:57.589 --> 00:18:00.589
