00:18:19.069 --> 00:18:20.069
Clark.

00:18:20.069 --> 00:18:21.069
Before you?

00:18:21.069 --> 00:18:23.069
Before you unload your anger on me,

00:18:23.069 --> 00:18:25.069
can I just say that I think it is incredibly unfair,

00:18:25.069 --> 00:18:28.069
