00:18:28.069 --> 00:18:30.069
and then they turn around and they throw me attitude

00:18:30.069 --> 00:18:32.069
for keeping someone else's secret?

00:18:32.069 --> 00:18:35.069
Look, I'm sorry that I had to take a two-second breather

00:18:35.069 --> 00:18:38.069
from hiding the fact that you are an alien from another planet

00:18:38.069 --> 00:18:41.069
to protect someone else for a change.

00:18:41.069 --> 00:19:08.640
You had that coming, you know?

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:18.460
For the record, I prefer intergalactic traveler

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.460
over alien from another planet.

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:52.470
Hey!

00:19:52.470 --> 00:19:53.470
Hey!

00:19:53.470 --> 00:19:56.470
Thanks for finally returning one of my phone calls.

00:19:56.470 --> 00:20:03.779
How much does Lana Lang's personal life boost newspaper sales these days?

00:20:03.779 --> 00:20:07.779
Okay. I was expecting that.

00:20:07.779 --> 00:20:11.779
But to be honest, I was kind of hoping you give me the benefit of the doubt.

00:20:11.779 --> 00:20:13.779
I guess there's a shortage of those today.

00:20:13.779 --> 00:20:17.779
That article recites our conversation verbatim.

00:20:17.779 --> 00:20:20.779
Do you honestly think I would betray you like that, Lana?

00:20:20.779 --> 00:20:21.779
What other explanation is there?

00:20:21.779 --> 00:20:25.779
I'm not sure. But the Lana Lang I know would at least give me a

00:20:25.779 --> 00:20:32.000
a chance to find one.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:34.000
After Clark, I guess I'm so jaded.

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:39.109
I don't even know what to expect from my friends anymore.

00:20:39.109 --> 00:20:41.109
So I take it, the conversation didn't go so well.

00:20:41.109 --> 00:20:42.109
Conversation.

00:20:42.109 --> 00:20:45.109
Clark left the town to go talk to you.

00:20:45.109 --> 00:20:46.109
About what?

00:20:46.109 --> 00:20:53.160
Well, I don't...

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:55.160
I should just put a bag over my head that says,

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.160
if you want to keep a secret, don't tell me.

00:20:57.160 --> 00:21:00.789
What did he want to say?

00:21:00.789 --> 00:21:03.789
You two need to okay, carow it on your own,

00:21:03.789 --> 00:21:04.789
because I've been blamed for putting words in people's mouth.

00:21:04.789 --> 00:21:06.789
words in people's mouths enough for one day.

00:21:06.789 --> 00:21:10.579
I'm sorry I didn't trust it.

00:21:10.579 --> 00:21:18.630
I don't understand how every intimate detail of my life is being leaked into Linda Lake's column.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:24.630
From what I found out, her reconnaissance techniques aren't exactly from the journal's code of ethics.

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:28.630
I think it's time we turn the tables on our little resident lawyer.

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:38.289
Hey, I got your call. What's the 911?

00:21:38.289 --> 00:21:42.289
I've been thinking. Maybe your Oliver theory isn't so far out there.

00:21:42.289 --> 00:21:44.289
And if he is the green arrow, you deserve to know the truth.

00:21:44.289 --> 00:21:45.289
Really?

00:21:45.289 --> 00:21:51.289
Really? Because I've been doing some thinking of my own, and maybe I don't want to know.

00:21:51.289 --> 00:21:56.289
I went through all the articles on Green Hour's crimes, and what if we just got off on the wrong foot?

00:21:56.289 --> 00:22:00.289
I mean, the whole rob from the rich to give to the poor thing, that wins him some points, right?

00:22:00.289 --> 00:22:01.289
Are you feeling okay?

00:22:01.289 --> 00:22:05.289
No, I'm not all right, Clark. I think I'm in love with Oliver.

00:22:05.289 --> 00:22:09.289
I don't know how you ever let Lana go if you felt this way, because...

00:22:09.289 --> 00:22:15.269
I swear the guy could tell me he was from Mars right now, and I would find a way to dismiss it as an endearing

00:22:15.289 --> 00:22:17.289
Quirk.

00:22:17.289 --> 00:22:19.289
Lois, you like a pit bull on a pant leg.

00:22:19.289 --> 00:22:24.019
You're never going to let this go until you know for sure.

00:22:24.019 --> 00:22:26.019
I hate that you know me like that.

00:22:26.019 --> 00:22:30.019
But I can't just pull a Lois and ambush him.

00:22:30.019 --> 00:22:34.000
What if I'm wrong?

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:35.000
What if you never need to confront him?

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:48.529
It's exciting? Our first group movie night?

00:22:48.529 --> 00:22:50.529
I mean, don't you just love spontaneity?

00:22:50.529 --> 00:22:53.970
Let me get it.

00:22:53.970 --> 00:22:58.970
Clark, come on in. Let me get your jacket.

00:22:58.970 --> 00:23:01.539
Thanks for having me over.

